id: pm-rl-wrwi
title: Resolve CodeRabbit round-6 review findings on PR 16
description: "Eight findings from the sixth bot review pass: a stale open-status claim on a closed review task, malformed regression-test provenance in a feature record, untrimmed gate names at the parse boundary, unquoted assigned-secret assignments not scanned, sweep plan reporting the requested id instead of the host-resolved id, duplicated parse-and-narrow in receipt.ts, a duplicated comment sentence in the gate episode test, and duplicated dependency-marker constants between transfer.ts and index.ts."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-26T21:10:48.281Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-26T22:32:16.673Z"
