close_reason: "All 8 round-6 findings resolved: 6 VALID code fixes with revert-verified tests, 1 VALID pm data provenance fix, 1 INVALID stale claim. Gates: 237/237 tests, coverage 100/100/100/100, docstring 129 declarations, jscpd 0 clones, changelog check green, pm health strict-exit green."
